      "title": "💎 Guide: Full-Quality 25-Step 360° VR Panorama (2K)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 💎 Qwen 360 Full Quality Panorama Studio (4K Bilateral Pipeline)\n\nPristine 25-step production generation + **4K RealESRGAN 2×** + **Subtle Bilateral Cleanup**.\n\n### 🔄 Full Pipeline\n1. **Text/Image Conditioning**: Pano360 LoRA spherical backbone.\n2. **25-step Euler Sampling**: High-precision denoising for crisp architectural & landscape geometry.\n3. **4K Toroidal Upscale**: RealESRGAN 2× with 5% boundary wrap.\n4. **Subtle Bilateral Filter**: Mild d=5, sigmaColor=15 edge-preserving noise cleanup.\n5. **VR 360 Viewer & Export**: Interactive WebGL sphere viewer + Photo Sphere XMP metadata."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# 💎 Qwen 360 Full Quality Panorama Studio (4K Bilateral Pipeline)\n\nPristine 25-step production generation + **4K RealESRGAN 2×** + **Subtle Bilateral Cleanup**.\n\n### 🔄 Full Pipeline\n1. **Text/Image Conditioning**: Pano360 LoRA spherical backbone.\n2. **25-step Euler Sampling**: High-precision denoising for crisp architectural & landscape geometry.\n3. **4K Toroidal Upscale**: RealESRGAN 2× with 5% boundary wrap.\n4. **Subtle Bilateral Filter**: Mild d=5, sigmaColor=15 edge-preserving noise cleanup.\n5. **VR 360 Viewer & Export**: Interactive WebGL sphere viewer + Photo Sphere XMP metadata."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
